// ═══ v676 — tap a preset chip and that personality is LIVE ═══════════════
// v645 proved half-applied presets are invisible and dangerous, and the ask is
// direct: choosing 🛡 Defender, ⚖ All-rounder or ⚡ Hunter must mean the bot
// AUTO-BUYS with that set - not "filled a form someone may forget to save".
// So a chip tap applies the preset's exits + band + 2% dip entry, the shared
