  // the NETWORK attempt further down. Dead-listed symbols with stored rows
  // were returning null and sitting on "?" although their data was on-device.
  if(!forceNet && _histCache.has(ckey))return _histCache.get(ckey);   // instant on repeat (session) — v308: forceNet means LIVE, bypass the session cache too (it was handing slim rows back to the OHLC retry)
  // Persistent disk cache (from a bulk download). FRESHNESS RULE:
