        // "prepare 2,000 shares" run from crawling on slow-proxy days when you
        // already have the data downloaded. Fresh prices still come via ⚡ Load /
        // Redownload when you want them.
        // (stale fallback captured above — v238)
        // ── SAME-DAY HEAL (the "slow morning load" fix): if we know the
