  // v233: when the offline store covers the market, ALWAYS prepare every share —
  // disk reads are free, so nothing is left showing "?" beyond a depth cut-off.
  if(window._preferOffline) depth=allData.length;
  // ── API BUDGET ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // With a 100,000/day limit, fetching the full ASX (~4,300 = 1 call each) is a
  // small fraction of the budget, so we no longer cap live prepares. We still
  // prefer offline data when present (instant, zero calls); when live, we allow
